          preferred package and decoration requirements. We\'ll help\\r\\n                    you plan a beautiful setup for your special occasion.\"}}','[]',1,80,50,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(6,'Blogs','blogs','default','Wedding & Event Decoration Ideas Blog | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Decoration ideas, theme tips and planning guides for weddings, haldi, mehendi and events. Helpful articles from our wedding d├⌐cor team in Uttar Pradesh.','wedding decoration ideas, decoration blog, wedding planning tips, mehendi decoration ideas','Wedding & Event Decoration <span>Ideas, Inspiration & Planning Tips</span>',NULL,'Discover beautiful wedding decoration ideas, Haldi and Mehendi d├⌐cor inspiration, flower decoration trends, event planning tips and creative celebration ideas from Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507504031003-b417219a0fde?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Event Decor\", \"category\": \"Event Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531058020387-3be344556be6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Haldi Decor\", \"category\": \"Haldi Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519225421980-715cb0215aed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Mehendi Decor\", \"category\": \"Mehendi Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511578314322-379afb476865?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Balloon Decor\", \"category\": \"Balloon Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492684223066-81342ee5ff30?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Birthday Decor\", \"category\": \"Birthday Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1478146896981-b80fe463b330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Flower Decor\", \"category\": \"Flower Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Wedding & Event Decoration Journal\", \"text_2\": \"Start With Our Latest Wedding Ideas\", \"text_3\": \"Get practical inspiration for wedding decoration,\\r\\n                    function d├⌐cor and event planning before you start\\r\\n                    designing your celebration.\", \"text_4\": \"How to Choose the Right Wedding Decoration\\r\\n                        for Your Celebration\", \"text_5\": \"Learn how to choose a wedding d├⌐cor style according\\r\\n                        to your venue, function, theme, colours and overall\\r\\n                        celebration requirements.\", \"text_6\": \"Explore decoration inspiration, planning tips and\\r\\n                        function-specific ideas for your next celebration.\", \"text_7\": \"Elegant Wedding Decoration Ideas\\r\\n                                for a Memorable Celebration\", \"text_8\": \"Discover elegant d├⌐cor concepts that can\\r\\n                                transform your wedding venue into a beautiful\\r\\n                                celebration space.\", \"text_9\": \"Beautiful Haldi Decoration Ideas\\r\\n                                for a Colourful Function\", \"text_10\": \"From floral backdrops to vibrant seating,\\r\\n                                explore ideas for creating a memorable\\r\\n                                Haldi celebration.\", \"text_11\": \"Flower Decoration Ideas for\\r\\n                                Weddings & Functions\", \"text_12\": \"Explore floral decoration styles that bring\\r\\n                                elegance, freshness and a beautiful visual\\r\\n                                identity to celebrations.\", \"text_13\": \"Mehendi Decoration Ideas\\r\\n                                for a Stylish Celebration\", \"text_14\": \"Create a vibrant Mehendi setup with colourful\\r\\n                                d├⌐cor, floral details and beautiful guest areas.\", \"text_15\": \"Complete Event Decoration Ideas\\r\\n                                for Special Occasions\", \"text_16\": \"Plan a complete event setup with coordinated\\r\\n                                d├⌐cor, entrance styling, stage design and\\r\\n                                guest-focused details.\", \"text_17\": \"Wedding Decoration Planning:\\r\\n                                What You Should Decide First\", \"text_18\": \"Understand the important d├⌐cor decisions\\r\\n                                to make before your wedding decoration\\r\\n                                planning begins.\", \"text_19\": \"Find Inspiration for Every Celebration\", \"text_20\": \"Browse ideas according to your wedding function,\\r\\n                    decoration requirement or event planning need.\", \"text_21\": \"Elegant wedding d├⌐cor ideas, themes,\\r\\n                            backdrops and venue styling inspiration.\", \"text_22\": \"Colourful function decoration ideas for\\r\\n                            Haldi and Mehendi celebrations.\", \"text_23\": \"Balloon decoration, birthdays and\\r\\n                            creative event styling inspiration.\", \"text_24\": \"Useful planning guidance for choosing\\r\\n                            d├⌐cor, venues and event requirements.\", \"text_25\": \"Let\'s Create Something Beautiful\", \"text_26\": \"Have a Celebration in Mind?\\r\\n                        Let\'s Plan Your D├⌐cor.\", \"text_27\": \"Tell us about your wedding, function or event\\r\\n                        and our team can help you plan a beautiful\\r\\n                        decoration setup according to your requirements.\"}}','[]',1,70,60,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(7,'FAQ','faq','default','Wedding Decoration FAQs | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Answers to common questions about wedding and event decoration ΓÇö services, pricing, customisation, booking, service areas and same-day decoration.','wedding decoration faq, decoration questions, wedding decorator answers','Frequently Asked Questions <span>About Wedding & Event Decoration</span>',NULL,'Find answers to common questions about our wedding decoration, Haldi, Mehendi, Chunni ceremony, flower, balloon and complete event decoration services. Learn more about our services, customization options, planning process and service areas before planning your celebration.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519225421980-715cb0215aed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Event Decor\", \"category\": \"Event Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507504031003-b417219a0fde?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Haldi Decor\", \"category\": \"Haldi Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513159446162-54eb8bdaa79b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Mehendi Decor\", \"category\": \"Mehendi Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519167758481-83f550bb49b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Balloon Decor\", \"category\": \"Balloon Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Wedding & Event Decoration FAQs\", \"text_2\": \"Wedding stages, entrances & d├⌐cor\", \"text_3\": \"Haldi, Mehendi & ceremonies\", \"text_4\": \"Birthdays, parties & celebrations\", \"text_5\": \"Booking, location & requirements\", \"text_6\": \"Everything You Need To Know\", \"text_7\": \"Planning a wedding or special event involves many\\r\\n                            small decisions. Our FAQ section answers common\\r\\n                            questions about decoration services, customization,\\r\\n                            occasions, locations and enquiries.\", \"text_8\": \"If you have a specific requirement that is not\\r\\n                            covered below, you can contact our team directly\\r\\n                            and discuss your event date, venue and preferred\\r\\n                            decoration style.\", \"text_9\": \"Customized decoration planning\", \"text_10\": \"Wedding & event decoration\", \"text_11\": \"Service available in nearby areas\", \"text_12\": \"Talk To Our Decoration Team\", \"text_13\": \"Frequently Asked Questions\", \"text_14\": \"Common questions about wedding decoration, stages,\\r\\n                    entrances, backdrops and complete wedding d├⌐cor.\", \"text_15\": \"Haldi, Mehendi & Ceremony\", \"text_16\": \"Learn more about decoration for Haldi, Mehendi, Chunni\\r\\n                    Ceremony and other traditional wedding functions.\", \"text_17\": \"Birthday & Event Decoration\", \"text_18\": \"Common questions about balloon decoration, birthdays,\\r\\n                    anniversaries, parties and special events.\", \"text_19\": \"Important information about event dates, customization,\\r\\n                    service areas and getting in touch with our team.\", \"text_20\": \"Explore our individual decoration services to find the\\r\\n                    right option for your wedding, function, party or special\\r\\n                    celebration.\", \"text_21\": \"Colourful and custom balloon d├⌐cor for birthdays,\\r\\n                            weddings and celebrations.\", \"text_22\": \"Colourful Haldi decoration for vibrant\\r\\n                            pre-wedding celebrations.\", \"text_23\": \"Stylish Mehendi decoration with colourful and\\r\\n                            elegant themed styling.\", \"text_24\": \"Elegant floral decoration for stages, entrances,\\r\\n                            backdrops and venues.\", \"text_25\": \"If you could not find the answer you were looking for,\\r\\n                        share your event date, venue and decoration\\r\\n                        requirements with our team.\"}}','[{\"answer\": \"Yes. We provide wedding decoration solutions including stages, backdrops, entrances, flower decoration, wedding counters and complete event d├⌐cor according to the event requirements.\", \"category\": \"wedding\", \"question\": \"Do you provide wedding decoration services?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. Wedding decoration can be planned around your preferred colours, theme, venue layout, event type and specific decoration requirements.\", \"category\": \"wedding\", \"question\": \"Can wedding decoration be customized?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. Flower decoration can be planned for wedding stages, entrances, backdrops, venues and selected celebration spaces.\", \"category\": \"wedding\", \"question\": \"Do you provide flower decoration for weddings?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. Complete event d├⌐cor can include multiple decoration elements planned together according to your wedding venue, functions and overall requirements.\", \"category\": \"wedding\", \"question\": \"Do you provide complete wedding event d├⌐cor?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. We provide colourful Haldi decoration setups designed around the function, venue, preferred colours and overall celebration style.\", \"category\": \"function\", \"question\": \"Do you provide Haldi decoration?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. Mehendi decoration can include colourful themed styling, decorative backdrops and arrangements suited to the celebration space.\", \"category\": \"function\", \"question\": \"Do you provide Mehendi decoration?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. We provide graceful decoration arrangements for Chunni Ceremony and traditional wedding functions according to the venue and requirements.\", \"category\": \"function\", \"question\": \"Do you provide Chunni Ceremony decoration?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. Multiple functions can be planned separately or as part of a broader decoration requirement, depending on your event schedule and venue arrangements.\", \"category\": \"function\", \"question\": \"Can multiple wedding functions be decorated?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. We create balloon decoration setups for birthdays, anniversaries, family celebrations and other special occasions.\", \"category\": \"event\", \"question\": \"Do you provide balloon decoration for birthdays?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. Balloon decoration can be customized according to your preferred colours, celebration theme, venue layout and event requirements.\", \"category\": \"event\", \"question\": \"Can balloon decoration be customized?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. We provide decoration solutions for parties, birthdays, anniversaries, family functions and other special gatherings.\", \"category\": \"event\", \"question\": \"Do you decorate parties and family events?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. Complete event d├⌐cor can be planned around the venue, event type, decoration requirements and overall visual theme.\", \"category\": \"event\", \"question\": \"Do you provide complete event decoration?\"}, {\"answer\": \"We provide wedding and event decoration across Uttar Pradesh, including Bulandshahr, Khurja, Sikandrabad, Dadri, Jewar, Gulaothi, Dibai, Shikarpur, Jahangirabad, Anupshahr, Greater Noida, Aligarh, Meerut, Agra, Ghaziabad, Kanpur and Lucknow. Open the Locations page to find your city.\", \"category\": \"booking\", \"question\": \"Which areas do you serve?\"}, {\"answer\": \"It is recommended to contact the team as early as possible with your event date, venue and decoration requirements so that the decoration plan can be discussed according to availability.\", \"category\": \"booking\", \"question\": \"How early should I contact you?\"}, {\"answer\": \"You can share your event date, event type, venue or address, preferred decoration service, approximate requirements and any specific theme or colour preferences.\", \"category\": \"booking\", \"question\": \"What information should I share for an enquiry?\"}, {\"answer\": \"You can contact our team through the Contact Us page or call and WhatsApp our team directly, then share your event requirements.\", \"category\": \"booking\", \"question\": \"How can I contact your team?\"}]',1,60,70,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(8,'Service Areas','locations','default','Service Areas | Wedding Decoration in Uttar Pradesh & Nearby Cities','List of all cities, towns and villages where Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners provides wedding and event decoration service. Open your city page and book online.','wedding decoration service areas, wedding decorator list, uttar pradesh wedding decoration','Our Wedding & Event Decoration <span>Service Areas</span>',NULL,'Choose your state, district and city to read full details about wedding decoration, haldi, mehendi, balloon, flower and complete event d├⌐cor services available in your area.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519167758481-83f550bb49b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519167758481-83f550bb49b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519167758481-83f550bb49b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464366400600-7168b8af9bc3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Event Decor\", \"category\": \"Event Decor\"}]','[]','[]',1,80,80,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-10-20 23:47:58',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(9,'Contact Us','contact-us','default','Contact Us | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Contact Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners for wedding, haldi, mehendi, birthday and event decoration in Agra, Aligarh, Bulandshahr, Gautam Buddh Nagar, Ghaziabad, Hapur, Meerut and Mathura.','contact wedding decorator, wedding decoration booking, event decoration enquiry','Contact Your Trusted <span>Wedding & Event Decoration Team</span>',NULL,'Planning a wedding, Haldi, Mehendi, birthday, ceremony or special event? Tell Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners about your occasion and let us help you plan a decoration setup in Agra, Aligarh, Bulandshahr, Gautam Buddh Nagar, Ghaziabad, Hapur, Meerut and Mathura.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519225421980-715cb0215aed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Event Decor\", \"category\": \"Event Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Let\'s Plan Your Celebration\", \"text_2\": \"Discuss your event, venue and decoration\\r\\n                            requirements directly with our team.\", \"text_3\": \"Share your event date, venue and decoration\\r\\n                            requirements with us on WhatsApp.\", \"text_4\": \"Every event has different requirements.\\r\\n                            Share a few details about your celebration\\r\\n                            and our team can understand what kind of\\r\\n                            decoration setup you are looking for.\", \"text_5\": \"Whether you need Haldi decoration, Mehendi\\r\\n                            decoration, Flower Decoration, Balloon\\r\\n                            Decoration, Wedding Counters or Complete\\r\\n                            Event D├⌐cor, start your enquiry here.\", \"text_6\": \"Date, time, venue and event type.\", \"text_7\": \"Tell us the service you need.\", \"text_8\": \"Discuss Your Requirements\", \"text_9\": \"We can discuss the right d├⌐cor direction.\", \"text_10\": \"Fill in your details and tell us what\\r\\n                                you are planning.\", \"text_11\": \"Chunni Ceremony Decoration\", \"text_12\": \"What Can We Decorate For You?\", \"text_13\": \"Explore individual services before sending your\\r\\n                    enquiry and find the decoration style that best\\r\\n                    matches your celebration.\", \"text_14\": \"Creative party & event styling\", \"text_15\": \"Bright & colorful ceremony d├⌐cor\", \"text_16\": \"Vibrant wedding ceremony styling\", \"text_17\": \"Traditional & elegant d├⌐cor\", \"text_18\": \"Special event effects & d├⌐cor\", \"text_19\": \"Floral stages & venue styling\", \"text_20\": \"Complete celebration styling\", \"text_21\": \"Let\'s Make Your Celebration\\r\\n                        Look Extraordinary\", \"text_22\": \"Share your event details with Anuj Kumar Wedding\\r\\n                        Event Planners and let\'s discuss a decoration\\r\\n                        concept that suits your occasion and venue.\"}, \"hours\": \"Open all days, 9:00 AM to 8:00 PM\", \"eyebrow\": \"Let\'s Plan Your Celebration\", \"highlights\": [\"Quick Enquiry\", \"Customized D├⌐cor\", \"Coverage Across Uttar Pradesh\"], \"phone_note\": \"Discuss your event, venue and decoration requirements directly with our team.\", \"whatsapp_note\": \"Share your event date, venue and decoration requirements with us on WhatsApp.\"}','[]',1,80,90,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(10,'Sitemap','sitemap','default','Sitemap | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Complete list of pages on our website ΓÇö services, packages, blogs, service areas and important information.',NULL,'Explore Our Website <span>Wedding & Event Decoration Services</span>',NULL,'Explore all important pages, wedding decoration services, event decoration solutions, packages, gallery, blogs, frequently asked questions and contact information from Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Our sitemap makes it easy to discover every important\\r\\n                        section of the website. Browse our wedding and event\\r\\n                        decoration services, explore our work, read helpful\\r\\n                        decoration ideas and get in touch with our team.\", \"text_2\": \"Whether you are planning a wedding, Haldi, Mehendi,\\r\\n                        Chunni ceremony, birthday party or a complete event,\\r\\n                        you can quickly find the right information below.\", \"text_3\": \"Simple Website Navigation\", \"text_4\": \"Explore services, pages, resources and\\r\\n                            event planning information.\", \"text_5\": \"Quickly access our main pages, decoration services,\\r\\n                    resources and useful information.\", \"text_6\": \"Wedding & Event Decoration Services\", \"text_7\": \"Stylish balloon decoration for birthdays,\\r\\n                                parties and special celebrations.\", \"text_8\": \"Colourful and vibrant decoration ideas for\\r\\n                                beautiful Haldi ceremonies.\", \"text_9\": \"Elegant Mehendi setups designed around your\\r\\n                                celebration theme and style.\", \"text_10\": \"Chunni Ceremony Decoration\", \"text_11\": \"Beautiful traditional d├⌐cor for memorable\\r\\n                                Chunni ceremony celebrations.\", \"text_12\": \"Creative traditional event styling with\\r\\n                                Fogg & Matka decoration elements.\", \"text_13\": \"Attractive and functional counters for\\r\\n                                weddings and special events.\", \"text_14\": \"Elegant floral decoration for stages,\\r\\n                                entrances, venues and ceremonies.\", \"text_15\": \"Complete decoration solutions for weddings,\\r\\n                                functions, parties and special occasions.\", \"text_16\": \"Planning & Helpful Resources\", \"text_17\": \"Discover inspiration and practical ideas for\\r\\n                                planning beautiful celebrations.\", \"text_18\": \"Frequently Asked Questions\", \"text_19\": \"Get quick answers about decoration services,\\r\\n                                planning and enquiries.\", \"text_20\": \"View decoration inspiration for weddings,\\r\\n                                functions and celebrations.\", \"text_21\": \"Explore event decoration packages and\\r\\n                                choose a suitable celebration setup.\", \"text_22\": \"Legal & Website Information\", \"text_23\": \"Planning Something Special?\", \"text_24\": \"Let\'s Create a Celebration\", \"text_25\": \"Explore our services or contact our team to discuss\\r\\n                        your wedding, Haldi, Mehendi, birthday, party or\\r\\n                        complete event decoration requirements.\"}}','[]',1,30,100,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(11,'Privacy Policy','privacy-policy','default','Privacy Policy | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Read how Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners collects, uses and protects the information you share through our website, enquiry forms and communication channels.',NULL,'Privacy Policy <span>Your Privacy Matters to Us</span>',NULL,'Learn how Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners collects, uses and protects information shared through our website, enquiry forms and communication channels.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Website Privacy & Data Protection\", \"text_2\": \"At Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners, we respect the\\r\\n                        privacy of visitors and customers who use our website\\r\\n                        to explore wedding and event decoration services or\\r\\n                        contact our team.\", \"text_3\": \"This Privacy Policy explains the general way in which\\r\\n                        information submitted through our website may be\\r\\n                        handled and used to respond to enquiries and provide\\r\\n                        relevant services.\", \"text_4\": \"We aim to handle information responsibly and only\\r\\n                            use it for legitimate business and communication\\r\\n                            purposes.\", \"text_5\": \"Information We May Collect\", \"text_6\": \"When you use our website or contact us regarding\\r\\n                                wedding and event decoration services, you may\\r\\n                                voluntarily provide information such as your\\r\\n                                name, mobile number, event type, event date,\\r\\n                                event time, venue or address and additional\\r\\n                                requirements.\", \"text_7\": \"We may also receive information that you choose\\r\\n                                to share with us when communicating through\\r\\n                                enquiry forms, phone calls, WhatsApp or other\\r\\n                                available communication channels.\", \"text_8\": \"How We Use Your Information\", \"text_9\": \"Information submitted through the website may\\r\\n                                be used to understand your event requirements,\\r\\n                                respond to your enquiry and provide information\\r\\n                                about suitable wedding or event decoration\\r\\n                                services.\", \"text_10\": \"Respond to decoration enquiries.\", \"text_11\": \"Understand your event requirements.\", \"text_12\": \"Discuss event date, venue and decoration needs.\", \"text_13\": \"Provide relevant service information.\", \"text_14\": \"Enquiry & Contact Information\", \"text_15\": \"If you submit an enquiry through our website,\\r\\n                                the information you provide may be used by our\\r\\n                                team to contact you regarding your requested\\r\\n                                wedding or event decoration service.\", \"text_16\": \"Please provide accurate information so that our\\r\\n                                team can understand your requirements and\\r\\n                                communicate with you effectively.\", \"text_17\": \"WhatsApp & External Communication\", \"text_18\": \"Our website may provide links that allow you to\\r\\n                                contact us through WhatsApp or other external\\r\\n                                communication platforms. When you use an\\r\\n                                external platform, its own privacy policy and\\r\\n                                terms may also apply.\", \"text_19\": \"We recommend reviewing the privacy practices of\\r\\n                                any third-party platform before sharing personal\\r\\n                                information through that platform.\", \"text_20\": \"We take reasonable steps to protect information\\r\\n                                shared with us from unauthorized access,\\r\\n                                misuse or disclosure. However, no website or\\r\\n                                internet transmission can be guaranteed to be\\r\\n                                completely secure.\", \"text_21\": \"Our website may contain links to external\\r\\n                                websites or services. These websites operate\\r\\n                                independently and may have their own privacy\\r\\n                                policies, terms and data practices.\", \"text_22\": \"We are not responsible for the privacy practices\\r\\n                                or content of third-party websites.\", \"text_23\": \"Our website or its supporting technologies may\\r\\n                                use cookies or similar technologies to improve\\r\\n                                website functionality, understand website usage\\r\\n                                and provide a better browsing experience.\", \"text_24\": \"You can manage cookie preferences through your\\r\\n                                browser settings where supported.\", \"text_25\": \"You may choose what information you provide when\\r\\n                                contacting us. If you do not wish to provide\\r\\n                                certain information, you may still browse the\\r\\n                                publicly available sections of our website,\\r\\n                                although some enquiry or communication features\\r\\n                                may require relevant details.\", \"text_26\": \"Changes to This Privacy Policy\", \"text_27\": \"We may update this Privacy Policy from time to\\r\\n                                time to reflect changes in our website,\\r\\n                                services or business practices. Any updated\\r\\n                                version will be published on this page.\", \"text_28\": \"If you have any questions about this Privacy\\r\\n                                Policy or how information is handled, you can\\r\\n                                contact Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners\\r\\n                                directly.\", \"text_29\": \"Please read this policy to understand how\\r\\n                            information submitted through our website may be\\r\\n                            handled.\", \"text_30\": \"Talk to our team about wedding and event\\r\\n                            decoration requirements.\", \"text_31\": \"Explore our wedding and event decoration services or get\\r\\n                    in touch with our team to discuss your celebration.\", \"text_32\": \"Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners\", \"text_33\": \"Explore our decoration services or contact our team\\r\\n                        to discuss your wedding, Haldi, Mehendi, birthday,\\r\\n                        party or complete event decoration requirements.\"}}','[]',1,20,110,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(12,'Terms & Conditions','terms-and-conditions','default','Terms & Conditions | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Terms and conditions for using our website and booking our wedding and event decoration services in Uttar Pradesh.',NULL,'Terms & Conditions <span>For Using Our Website & Services</span>',NULL,'Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using the Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners website, exploring our decoration services or submitting an event enquiry.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Website Terms & Conditions\", \"text_2\": \"These Terms & Conditions describe the general terms\\r\\n                        applicable to visitors and users of the Anuj Kumar\\r\\n                        Wedding Event Planners website.\", \"text_3\": \"By accessing or using this website, you acknowledge\\r\\n                        that you have read and understood these terms and agree\\r\\n                        to use the website responsibly.\", \"text_4\": \"Website information is provided to help visitors\\r\\n                            understand our services and make enquiries.\", \"text_5\": \"By accessing and using this website, you agree\\r\\n                                to comply with these Terms & Conditions and\\r\\n                                applicable laws. If you do not agree with any\\r\\n                                part of these terms, please discontinue use of\\r\\n                                the website.\", \"text_6\": \"We aim to provide useful and accurate\\r\\n                                information about our wedding and event\\r\\n                                decoration services. However, service\\r\\n                                availability, decoration designs, materials,\\r\\n                                arrangements and other event details may vary\\r\\n                                depending on individual requirements.\", \"text_7\": \"Website content may be updated from time to\\r\\n                                time without prior notice.\", \"text_8\": \"Information submitted through our enquiry form\\r\\n                                is used to understand your event requirements\\r\\n                                and to communicate with you regarding the\\r\\n                                requested decoration service.\", \"text_9\": \"Submitting an enquiry does not automatically\\r\\n                                constitute a confirmed booking or guarantee\\r\\n                                availability for a particular event date.\", \"text_10\": \"Event Requirements & Customization\", \"text_11\": \"Wedding and event decoration requirements can\\r\\n                                differ based on venue, event size, decoration\\r\\n                                style, theme, materials, setup requirements and\\r\\n                                other factors.\", \"text_12\": \"Decoration concepts may be customized\\r\\n                                    according to event requirements.\", \"text_13\": \"Final arrangements depend on the agreed\\r\\n                                    event requirements.\", \"text_14\": \"Availability may vary according to the\\r\\n                                    requested event date.\", \"text_15\": \"Specific designs may depend on available\\r\\n                                    materials and venue conditions.\", \"text_16\": \"Decoration requirements can vary significantly\\r\\n                                from one event to another. Any pricing,\\r\\n                                quotation or estimate provided during an\\r\\n                                enquiry should be understood in relation to\\r\\n                                the specific event requirements discussed with\\r\\n                                our team.\", \"text_17\": \"A quotation or discussion does not itself\\r\\n                                represent a confirmed booking unless the\\r\\n                                booking has been mutually confirmed.\", \"text_18\": \"Event bookings are subject to availability and\\r\\n                                confirmation. Details such as event date,\\r\\n                                venue, decoration requirements and agreed\\r\\n                                arrangements may need to be finalized before\\r\\n                                an event is confirmed.\", \"text_19\": \"Visitors should contact our team directly for\\r\\n                                the latest information regarding availability\\r\\n                                and booking requirements.\", \"text_20\": \"Website text, graphics, photographs, layouts,\\r\\n                                branding and other content may be used for\\r\\n                                informational and promotional purposes.\", \"text_21\": \"You should not reproduce, copy, modify,\\r\\n                                republish or commercially use website content\\r\\n                                without appropriate authorization.\", \"text_22\": \"Our website may contain links to third-party\\r\\n                                websites or communication platforms. These\\r\\n                                services operate independently and may have\\r\\n                                their own terms, conditions and privacy\\r\\n                                policies.\", \"text_23\": \"We are not responsible for the content,\\r\\n                                availability or policies of external websites.\", \"text_24\": \"Responsible Use of the Website\", \"text_25\": \"Visitors are expected to use this website for\\r\\n                                lawful and legitimate purposes. You should not\\r\\n                                knowingly attempt to interfere with website\\r\\n                                functionality, misuse enquiry forms or engage\\r\\n                                in activities that could harm the website or\\r\\n                                its users.\", \"text_26\": \"Limitation of Information\", \"text_27\": \"Website information is intended for general\\r\\n                                informational purposes. Event decoration\\r\\n                                outcomes, availability, designs and\\r\\n                                arrangements may depend on individual event\\r\\n                                circumstances and requirements.\", \"text_28\": \"These Terms & Conditions may be updated from\\r\\n                                time to time to reflect changes in our website,\\r\\n                                services or business practices.\", \"text_29\": \"The latest version published on this page will\\r\\n                                apply to continued use of the website.\", \"text_30\": \"If you have questions regarding these Terms &\\r\\n                                Conditions or our wedding and event decoration\\r\\n                                services, please contact our team directly.\", \"text_31\": \"Use these links to quickly move through the main\\r\\n                            sections of our website terms.\", \"text_32\": \"Contact our team to discuss your wedding or event\\r\\n                            decoration requirements.\", \"text_33\": \"Explore our services, FAQs and privacy information before\\r\\n                    getting in touch with our team.\", \"text_34\": \"Explore our wedding and event decoration services.\", \"text_35\": \"Explore decoration packages for different events.\", \"text_36\": \"Frequently Asked Questions\", \"text_37\": \"Find answers to common decoration questions.\", \"text_38\": \"Learn how website information may be handled.\", \"text_39\": \"Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners\", \"text_40\": \"Explore our decoration services or contact our team\\r\\n                        to discuss your wedding, Haldi, Mehendi, birthday,\\r\\n                        party or complete event decoration requirements.\"}}','[]',1,20,120,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(13,'Disclaimer','disclaimer','default','Disclaimer | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Disclaimer for the Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners website, covering content, pricing, images and external links.',NULL,'Website Disclaimer <span>Important Information About Our Website</span>',NULL,'Please read this disclaimer carefully to understand the nature of the information published on the Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners website and how website content should be understood.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Website Information Disclaimer\", \"text_2\": \"Transparent Communication\", \"text_3\": \"The information published on this website is intended\\r\\n                        to help visitors understand our wedding and event\\r\\n                        decoration services, explore decoration ideas and\\r\\n                        contact our team regarding their event requirements.\", \"text_4\": \"While we aim to keep website information useful and\\r\\n                        accurate, actual event arrangements may vary depending\\r\\n                        on venue conditions, event requirements, availability,\\r\\n                        materials and other circumstances.\", \"text_5\": \"Website Information May Vary\", \"text_6\": \"Final service details should always be confirmed\\r\\n                            directly with our team.\", \"text_7\": \"The content available on this website is\\r\\n                                provided for general informational purposes.\\r\\n                                It is intended to give visitors an overview\\r\\n                                of our wedding and event decoration services,\\r\\n                                planning information and available contact\\r\\n                                options.\", \"text_8\": \"Website content should not be considered a\\r\\n                                final quotation, confirmed booking or binding\\r\\n                                service agreement unless specifically confirmed\\r\\n                                by our team.\", \"text_9\": \"Decoration Images & Examples\", \"text_10\": \"Images and visual examples displayed on the\\r\\n                                website may be used to provide inspiration\\r\\n                                and demonstrate possible decoration styles,\\r\\n                                themes, layouts and event setups.\", \"text_11\": \"The final appearance of an event decoration\\r\\n                                may differ from website images because of\\r\\n                                venue size, lighting, materials, availability,\\r\\n                                theme preferences and other event-specific\\r\\n                                factors.\", \"text_12\": \"The availability of any wedding or event\\r\\n                                decoration service depends on the requested\\r\\n                                event date, location, event requirements and\\r\\n                                our team\'s availability.\", \"text_13\": \"Services may vary according to event\\r\\n                                    requirements.\", \"text_14\": \"Availability should be confirmed before\\r\\n                                    making event arrangements.\", \"text_15\": \"Decoration concepts may be customized\\r\\n                                    according to the event.\", \"text_16\": \"Venue conditions may affect the final\\r\\n                                    decoration setup.\", \"text_17\": \"Prices for wedding and event decoration can\\r\\n                                vary according to event type, venue, decoration\\r\\n                                requirements, design, materials, scale and\\r\\n                                other factors.\", \"text_18\": \"Any pricing information discussed through the\\r\\n                                website or during an initial enquiry should be\\r\\n                                treated as subject to confirmation based on\\r\\n                                the specific event requirements.\", \"text_19\": \"No Guarantee of Availability\", \"text_20\": \"Displaying a service, decoration style or\\r\\n                                package on this website does not guarantee that\\r\\n                                the same service, design, material or setup\\r\\n                                will be available for every event.\", \"text_21\": \"Visitors should contact our team to confirm\\r\\n                                current availability and event-specific\\r\\n                                requirements.\", \"text_22\": \"External Links & Third-Party Services\", \"text_23\": \"This website may contain links to external\\r\\n                                websites, social media platforms, maps,\\r\\n                                communication services or other third-party\\r\\n                                resources.\", \"text_24\": \"These external services operate independently\\r\\n                                and may have their own terms, privacy policies\\r\\n                                and practices. We are not responsible for the\\r\\n                                content or policies of third-party websites.\", \"text_25\": \"Accuracy of Website Content\", \"text_26\": \"We make reasonable efforts to keep the\\r\\n                                information on this website useful and\\r\\n                                up-to-date. However, errors, omissions or\\r\\n                                changes may occur from time to time.\", \"text_27\": \"Service details, descriptions, images and other\\r\\n                                website information may be updated without\\r\\n                                prior notice.\", \"text_28\": \"Event-Specific Confirmation\", \"text_29\": \"Because every celebration is different, final\\r\\n                                event details should be discussed and confirmed\\r\\n                                directly with our team before making decisions\\r\\n                                based on information available on the website.\", \"text_30\": \"This may include decoration design, venue\\r\\n                                requirements, event timing, materials,\\r\\n                                availability and other arrangements.\", \"text_31\": \"We aim to keep the website accessible and\\r\\n                                functional, but continuous or uninterrupted\\r\\n                                availability cannot be guaranteed.\", \"text_32\": \"Website functionality may occasionally be\\r\\n                                affected by maintenance, technical issues,\\r\\n                                hosting problems or circumstances outside our\\r\\n                                reasonable control.\", \"text_33\": \"If you need clarification about any service,\\r\\n                                decoration concept, availability or information\\r\\n                                displayed on this website, please contact our\\r\\n                                team directly before making your event plans.\", \"text_34\": \"Review the main points about website information,\\r\\n                            service availability and event-specific\\r\\n                            confirmation.\", \"text_35\": \"Get event-specific information directly from our\\r\\n                            wedding and event decoration team.\", \"text_36\": \"Explore our decoration services and find the right\\r\\n                    decoration solution for your wedding, function or event.\", \"text_37\": \"Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners\", \"text_38\": \"Contact our team to discuss your wedding, Haldi,\\r\\n                        Mehendi, birthday, party or complete event decoration\\r\\n                        requirements and get event-specific information.\"}}','[]',1,20,130,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(14,'Wedding & Event Decoration Guide','wedding-event-decoration-guide','default','Wedding & Event Decoration Guide | Ideas, Themes & Planning Tips','A complete guide to wedding and event decoration ΓÇö choosing themes, colours, flowers, lighting and budgets, and picking the right d├⌐cor team for your celebration.','wedding decoration guide, event decoration ideas, wedding theme guide, decoration planning tips','Complete Wedding & Event <span>Decoration Planning Guide</span>',NULL,'Planning a wedding, Haldi, Mehendi, birthday or special celebration? Explore practical decoration ideas, theme planning tips, venue styling guidance and event decoration services to create a beautiful celebration that feels truly yours.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85','[{\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85\", \"title\": \"Wedding Decor\", \"category\": \"Wedding Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1465495976277-4387d4b0e4a6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Event Decor\", \"category\": \"Event Decor\"}, {\"image\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511285560929-80b456fea0bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\", \"title\": \"Haldi Decor\", \"category\": \"Haldi Decor\"}]','{\"copy\": {\"text_1\": \"Wedding & Event Decoration Planning Guide\", \"text_2\": \"Before You Start Decorating\", \"text_3\": \"Great Decoration Starts With\", \"text_4\": \"Beautiful event decoration is not only about flowers,\\r\\n                        lights or backdrops. The right decoration depends on\\r\\n                        the event type, venue, guest experience, colour palette,\\r\\n                        theme, available space and overall celebration style.\", \"text_5\": \"This guide brings the important planning decisions\\r\\n                        together in one place so you can understand what to\\r\\n                        consider before finalizing your wedding or event d├⌐cor.\", \"text_6\": \"Decide your event style and venue requirements\\r\\n                            before selecting individual decoration elements.\", \"text_7\": \"Choose the type of celebration you are planning and\\r\\n                    explore the most relevant decoration options.\", \"text_8\": \"Explore Our Decoration Services\", \"text_9\": \"Explore individual decoration services and discover which\\r\\n                    options can work best for your celebration.\", \"text_10\": \"Creative balloon styling for birthdays, parties and\\r\\n                        colourful celebrations.\", \"text_11\": \"Bright and traditional Haldi decoration designed\\r\\n                        around your celebration style.\", \"text_12\": \"Stylish Mehendi setups with floral, colourful and\\r\\n                        traditional decorative elements.\", \"text_13\": \"Chunni Ceremony Decoration\", \"text_14\": \"Elegant traditional d├⌐cor for meaningful family\\r\\n                        ceremonies and special occasions.\", \"text_15\": \"Traditional and creative decorative elements for\\r\\n                        functions and celebration setups.\", \"text_16\": \"Attractive counters designed to complement weddings\\r\\n                        and special event experiences.\", \"text_17\": \"Floral decoration for wedding stages, entrances,\\r\\n                        backdrops, venues and ceremonies.\", \"text_18\": \"Complete decoration solutions for weddings, functions,\\r\\n                        parties and special celebrations.\", \"text_19\": \"Planning these basic details early can make the\\r\\n                        decoration discussion much easier and help create a\\r\\n                        setup that matches your event.\", \"text_20\": \"Smart Decoration Planning\", \"text_21\": \"How To Choose The Right Decoration\", \"text_22\": \"The best decoration is the one that fits your event,\\r\\n                    venue, personality and overall celebration experience.\", \"text_23\": \"Understand the size, entrance, stage area, ceiling,\\r\\n                        available walls and guest movement before selecting\\r\\n                        large decoration elements.\", \"text_24\": \"Choose a small group of complementary colours instead\\r\\n                        of mixing too many unrelated decoration elements.\", \"text_25\": \"Your stage, backdrop or main celebration area should\\r\\n                        create a strong visual point for guests and photographs.\", \"text_26\": \"Sharing your event date and requirements early gives\\r\\n                        more time to discuss the decoration direction and\\r\\n                        availability.\", \"text_27\": \"Continue exploring our website for decoration ideas,\\r\\n                    packages, FAQs and examples.\", \"text_28\": \"Explore visual decoration inspiration.\", \"text_29\": \"Explore packages for different celebrations.\", \"text_30\": \"Read more planning and decoration ideas.\", \"text_31\": \"Find answers to common event questions.\", \"text_32\": \"Your Celebration Starts Here\", \"text_33\": \"Have Your Decoration Plan?\", \"text_34\": \"Share your event type, date, venue and decoration\\r\\n                        requirements with our team and let\'s explore the\\r\\n                        right setup for your celebration.\"}}','[]',1,60,140,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-11-06 02:09:27',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15,'Blog Detail','blog-detail','default','Blog Article | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Wedding and event decoration article from Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,20,150,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-10-22 22:55:49',NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(16,'Service Detail','service-detail','default','Service Detail | Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners','Wedding and event decoration service detail from Anuj Kumar Wedding Event Planners.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,20,160,'2026-10-19 05:01:21','2026-10-19 05:01:21',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
