ncept with premium props for family functions and wedding rituals.',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Premium Celebration',NULL,'2026-11-02 01:40:31','2026-11-02 01:40:31',NULL),(3,'Royal Celebration','royal-celebration','Luxury Event Styling',NULL,NULL,'Final quote depends on venue and requirements','An exclusive styling package for weddings and grand celebrations.','[\"Exclusive theme designs\", \"Luxury décor elements\", \"Wedding-ready styling\", \"Complete event décor\"]','[]','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519225421980-715cb0215aed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519225421980-715cb0215aed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85','[]',1,0,60,30,'2026-11-02 01:40:31','Royal Celebration | Decoration Package','An exclusive styling package for weddings and grand celebrations.',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Royal Celebration',NULL,'2026-11-02 01:40:31','2026-11-02 01:40:31',NULL);
